# KWarner preview PDF (program report printout)

When the user asks for **PDF creation, PDF updates, printout layout, or program-report print changes**, work in the **KWarner locked preview pipeline** — not the web UI unless they explicitly ask for web.

## PDFKit (locked — do not change)

These documents are **created with PDFKit** (`server/pdf/`, `PDFDocument` via `server/pdf/draw.js`). This is the **only** approved way to build and deliver program-report printouts.

| Do | Don't |
|----|-------|
| Edit PDFKit renderer + draw helpers | HTML/CSS print views, browser print, or client-side PDF libs |
| `npm run render:kwarner-preview` → commit PDFs → raw GitHub download links | Artifacts panel, blob URLs, or burnandbuilddiet.com unless explicitly asked |

## Pipeline (source of truth)

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| PDF engine | **PDFKit** — `server/pdf/draw.js` (`PDFDocument`) |
| Renderer | `server/pdf/renderProgramReportKwarnerLockedPreview.js` |
| Shared draw helpers | `server/pdf/drawSeminar.js`, `server/pdf/drawFrame.js` |
| Macro signal data | `js/foodPlanPrintout.js` |
| Payload | `js/programReportPrintout.js` + `js/kwarnerLockedPreviewFixtures.js` |
| Food list gram scaling | `js/stapleServingPrintout.js` — see `.cursor/rules/burn-engine-servings.mdc` |
| Render script | `scripts/render-kwarner-locked-preview.mjs` |
| Build metadata | `js/kwarnerPreviewBuild.js` (auto-generated) |
| 1982 reference PDF | `docs/archive/kwarner-1982-original.pdf` |

